<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 36pt;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14pt;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .label {
    font-weight: bold;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 150px;
  }
  .content {
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .table-container {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }
  .table-container td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .table-container .label-cell {
    text-align: left;
    width: 50%;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 60px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <h1>Dickinson</h1>
  <h2>Retirement Contribution Election Form</h2>

  <div class="section">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <div>
        <span class="label">Name:</span>
        <span class="content">{{ full_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>EMPLOYER DEFINED CONTRIBUTION RETIREMENT: This is for Dickinson College's retirement contribution equal to 8% of your base salary. You may choose to direct this money to either <span data-field="retirement_option_1">{{ retirement_option_1 }}</span> and/or <span data-field="retirement_option_2">{{ retirement_option_2 }}</span>. Percentages must be chosen in whole amounts and cannot exceed 8%. Please specify vendor(s) and percentage to each.</p>

    <table class="table-container">
      <tr>
        <td class="label-cell">To TIAA (101060)</td>
        <td><span data-field="contribution_percentage_1">{{ contribution_percentage_1 }}</span>%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="label-cell">To Fidelity (56444)</td>
        <td><span data-field="contribution_percentage_2">{{ contribution_percentage_2 }}</span>%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="label-cell">TOTAL (must equal 8%)</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_contribution_percentage">{{ total_contribution_percentage }}</span>%</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>EMPLOYEE RETIREMENT CALCULATIONS: This is YOUR contribution. You are limited in what you can contribute to your retirement fund by the sections of the IRS code known as 403(b), 415, and 402(g). For <span data-field="tax_year">{{ tax_year }}</span>, the limit is a maximum of <span data-field="annual_limit_amount">{{ annual_limit_amount }}</span> per calendar year. If you are 50 or older, you may contribute an additional <span data-field="catchup_contribution_amount">{{ catchup_contribution_amount }}</span>. Please specify vendor(s) and annual/per pay amounts.</p>

    <table class="table-container">
      <tr>
        <td class="label-cell">To TIAA (101060)</td>
        <td><span data-field="employee_amount_1">{{ employee_amount_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="employee_frequency_1">{{ employee_frequency_1 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="label-cell">To Fidelity (56444)</td>
        <td><span data-field="employee_amount_2">{{ employee_amount_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="employee_frequency_2">{{ employee_frequency_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="label-cell">TOTAL (see limits above)</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_employee_amount">{{ total_employee_amount }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>EMPLOYER DEFINED CONTRIBUTION RETIREMENT MATCH: This is for Dickinson College's retirement match contribution equal to <span data-field="match_percentage">{{ match_percentage }}</span>% of your base salary. To be eligible for this contribution, you MUST contribute at least <span data-field="minimum_contribution_percentage">{{ minimum_contribution_percentage }}</span>% of your own salary to a retirement account. You may choose to direct this money to either <span data-field="match_option_1">{{ match_option_1 }}</span> or <span data-field="match_option_2">{{ match_option_2 }}</span> for this contribution.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <table class="table-container">
      <tr>
        <td class="label-cell">To TIAA (101060)</td>
        <td><span data-field="match_amount_1">{{ match_amount_1 }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="label-cell">To Fidelity (56444)</td>
        <td><span data-field="match_amount_2">{{ match_amount_2 }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="label-cell">TOTAL</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_match_amount">{{ total_match_amount }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>By executing this Election Form, you acknowledge that the election shall continue in effect until either (i) your termination of employment with the College or (ii) you give written notice to the College that this Agreement shall be terminated or changed. Employee contribution amounts will be deducted from your paycheck over the course of the year. These deductions are in addition to the amount the College contributes directly to TIAA and/or Fidelity on your behalf.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Signature</span>
      <div style="height: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 5px;" data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="label">Date</span>
      <div style="height: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 5px;" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>Please forward to <span data-field="hr_department_name">{{ hr_department_name }}</span>.</p>
    <p>If you do not currently have a TIAA or Fidelity account, enrollment is required.</p>
  </div>
</div>